Sent: Tuesday, 20 October 2026 11:40
To: Mark de Boer; Hanna Schmidt; Marta Kowalska
Subject: RE: Customs migration to DMS - plan, tests and go-live

Nordline just told us that their DMS release slips from the end of October to=
 10 Nov. We cannot go live on 3 Nov without them, so I decided:

1. Go-live moves from 3 Nov to 17 Nov 2026.
2. No parallel formats: we do not run old and new declaration format side by =
side. One cut-over.
3. EWM change freeze in Rotterdam stays until 17 Nov (Hanna).
4. End-to-end test with customs stays on 4-6 Nov, at least 20 declarations.
5. Go/no-go call on 12 Nov, Mark decides.
6. Nordline test file is due 31 Oct.

Marta, please inform the customs test team.

Kind regards,
Ruud Jansen
